{"task_id": "HumanEval/79", "solution": "def decimal_to_binary(decimal):\n    \"\"\"Converts a non-negative decimal integer to its \"db\" prefixed and suffixed binary string.\n    Raises ValueError for non-integer or negative inputs.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(decimal, int):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be an integer.\")\n    if decimal < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    BINARY_PREFIX = \"db\"\n    BINARY_SUFFIX = \"db\"\n\n    if decimal == 0:\n        binary_str = \"0\"\n    else:\n        binary_str = bin(decimal)[2:]\n\n    return f\"{BINARY_PREFIX}{binary_str}{BINARY_SUFFIX}\""}
