{"task_id": "HumanEval/86", "solution": "def anti_shuffle(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Processes a string, sorting characters within each word while preserving word order and spacing.\n    Words are sorted based on ascending ASCII values of their characters.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_parts = []\n    current_word_chars = []\n\n    for char in s:\n        if char.isspace():\n            if current_word_chars:\n                # Sort characters of the accumulated word and append to result\n                result_parts.append(\"\".join(sorted(current_word_chars)))\n                current_word_chars = []  # Reset for the next word\n            result_parts.append(char)  # Append the whitespace character\n        else:\n            current_word_chars.append(char)  # Accumulate non-whitespace characters\n\n    # After the loop, append any remaining word\n    if current_word_chars:\n        result_parts.append(\"\".join(sorted(current_word_chars)))\n\n    return \"\".join(result_parts)"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "def encrypt(s):\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string by rotating alphabetic characters by 4 positions.\n    Case is preserved, and non-alphabetic characters are unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    ROTATION_SHIFT = 4\n    encrypted_chars = []\n    for char in s:\n        if 'a' <= char <= 'z':\n            shifted_char_code = ord('a') + (ord(char) - ord('a') + ROTATION_SHIFT) % 26\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(shifted_char_code))\n        elif 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            shifted_char_code = ord('A') + (ord(char) - ord('A') + ROTATION_SHIFT) % 26\n            encrypted_chars.append(chr(shifted_char_code))\n        else:\n            encrypted_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(encrypted_chars)"}
